
/obj/item/clothing/head/roguetown/helmet/blacksteel/legate
	name = "legate's helmet"
	desc = "Few were able to prove by loyalty and skill their right to receive a black steel helmet, melted down from the armor of fallen knights of the West and decorated with the remains of their banners. A legate is a general who serves the great governor of the House of Aurelius. \
	Every legate receives a golden mask cast from a mold of his face, proving his right to power. The top of the helmet is decorated with golden spikes, melted from the crowns of the nobles of the Black Empire.\
	</br>‎  </br>Whose face is hidden under this mask – a person or merely a docile instrument? When wearing the unchanging visage, try not to forget your own."
